      "reason": "The 512-point copula pilot projects about 10400 seconds for four chains at the unchanged 500 warmup and 800 retained settings. Before control production or scientific scores, increase the per-fit cap symmetrically for copula and both GP resolutions to four hours. The three control fits and their checks together have a five-hour cap. Keep the twelve-hour study cap, single CPU thread and 2 GiB memory limit. Charge 5.5 hours for inherited costs, exceeding the approximately 4.7 hours of recorded external calculations and reused selected/LISA posteriors; this leaves at least 1.5 hours for later work even if the whole new allocation is spent. Incomplete fits remain inconclusive."
